fitness_functions:
  - changed: `check-architecture-boundaries` now fails loudly when a scanned layer directory is missing, instead of returning an empty file list and reporting OK
  - changed: each provider dependency is confined to one package, so the git, sqlite and checks adapters cannot import LangChain4j even though merging the adapter modules put those libraries on one compile classpath
  - changed: Flyway was split into its own rule rather than sharing the SQLite message
  - unchanged: `modules/domain` and `modules/deterministic` still import only `java.*` and repository packages
  - unchanged: no boundary rule changed in `CHG-003`; the slice adds ports, adapters and a CLI command within existing layer boundaries
  - strengthened without a new check: `PhenotypeBridgeScorer` now fails the required-behaviour gate closed when a declared case produced no evidence, so the deterministic layer enforces the invariant rather than trusting the CLI to wire one check per declared case

